     "So ΔHf(CH₄) = ΔHc(C) + 2ΔHc(H₂) − ΔHc(CH₄).",
     "The same cycle can be modelled as an enthalpy level diagram, with the elements, the compound and the combustion products at different levels and arrows between them.",
