     "2C(s) + 3H₂(g) + ½O₂(g) → C₂H₅OH(l), ΔHf = −278 kJ mol⁻¹.",
     "The heat of formation of an element in its standard state is zero by definition, as nothing is formed, e.g. O₂(g), H₂(g) and C(graphite).",
